{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object nearby: approach, pick, if not visible: scan, if picked - inspect. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = PickObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
